{:adr-id "2607152700"
 :title "cloud-itonami-isic-0893 — Salt Extraction Operations Coordination"
 :date "2026-07-15"
 :author "Cloud Itonami Contributors"
 :status :accepted
 :context
 "ISIC Rev.4 0893 (Extraction of salt) had no prior actor implementation
  -- the registry entry pointed at a placeholder repo
  (gftdcojp/cloud-itonami-B0893) that was never created. A sibling agent
  originally assigned the neighboring class 0892 verified the live
  registry first, found 0892 is actually 'Extraction of peat', halted
  without writing anything, and identified 0893 as the true salt slot;
  this ADR's author independently re-verified {:id \"0893\" :name
  \"Extraction of salt\" :maturity :spec ...} against a fresh clone
  before proceeding. Fresh, from-scratch scaffold, built as part of a
  smaller, carefully verified batch after an earlier 18-agent haiku
  batch's 61% defect rate. Module shape mirrors sibling
  cloud-itonami-isic-0520 (Mining of lignite)'s verified module shape,
  domain-adapted for salt extraction: ISIC 0893 covers both rock-salt
  dry/underground mining and solution mining/evaporation, so the demo
  site directory seeds one site of each kind deliberately."
 :decision
 {:scope-boundary
  "Coordination-only actor. Closed four-op allowlist, all :effect
   :propose: log-production-record, schedule-maintenance,
   flag-safety-concern (always escalates), coordinate-shipment. An op
   outside this set is the same failure mode as forbidden-scope
   content, not a separate carve-out."
  :governor-rules
  "Three HARD, permanent, un-overridable checks: (1) site-unverified --
   target site must be independently :registered?/:verified? in the
   store, never trusted from the proposal's own claim; (2)
   effect-not-propose -- any :effect other than :propose is a claim to
   directly actuate outside governance; (3) scope-exclusion -- any
   proposal (any op) touching extraction-equipment-control (rock-salt:
   blasting/drill-and-blast/drilling-pattern/room-and-pillar/
   continuous-miner/excavation-sequencing; solution mining: brine-pump-
   control/injection-well-control/extraction-well-control/cavern-
   pressure-control/pond-gate-control/pond-valve-control/harvester-
   operation) or site-safety(-authority) territory (subsidence-control-
   decision, brine-containment-control, cavern-integrity-control,
   permit issuance, license suspension, compliance enforcement),
   evaluated unconditionally via a lower-cased EN+JA substring scan of
   the proposal's own content. Subsidence/brine-containment exclusion
   terms are deliberately qualified (control decision / containment
   control) so legitimate flag-safety-concern observations are never
   self-blocked -- exercised directly by
   legitimate-brine-containment-flag-is-not-scope-excluded. Escalation
   (soft): flag-safety-concern always, low confidence (<0.6).
   saltops.phase independently agrees -- flag-safety-concern never
   auto-commits at any phase."
  :module-shape
  "saltops.store (MemStore, string-keyed site directory seeded with a
   rock-salt site, a solution-mining site, and an unverified
   solar-evaporation site), advisor (SaltOpsAdvisor, mock + real-LLM
   seam via langchain.model, plus an :out-of-scope? test hook), governor
   (SaltExtractionGovernor), phase (0->3 rollout), operation
   (langgraph-clj StateGraph), sim (demo driver)."}
 :consequences
 ["Registry entry corrected in place (exact-text edit of the existing"
  " {:id \"0893\" ...} block): :repo/:business-id updated from the"
  " stale gftdcojp/cloud-itonami-B0893 placeholder to"
  " cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-0893, :maturity :implemented"
  "Actor repo cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-0893 scaffolded and"
  " pushed to main (8b52527b40b774d552f8c9b7ff05cf649debd25f)"
  "Test suite run directly by this session: Ran 45 tests containing 136"
  " assertions, 0 failures, 0 errors (both at push time and again from a"
  " fresh post-merge clone). clj-kondo: 0 errors, 0 warnings."]
 :references
